{
  "id": 5254,
  "title": "用于高效查找的二叉搜索树",
  "meta_title": "二叉搜索树（BST）详解",
  "meta_description": "理解二叉搜索树的性质、操作（查找、插入、删除）和性能。",
  "content": "<p>虽然普通树提供了分层组织，但**二叉搜索树（BST）**规定了特定的排序性质，使元素查找非常高效。这个性质是 BST 对查找密集型任务有作用的原因。</p>\n<p>二叉搜索树是一种二叉树（每个节点最多有两个子节点），其中每个节点都满足：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>节点左子树中的所有值都<em>小于</em>节点的值。</li>\n<li>节点右子树中的所有值都<em>大于</em>节点的值。</li>\n<li>左子树和右子树本身也必须是二叉搜索树。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>这个递归定义形成了一个有序结构。我们来看一个包含整数值的简单 BST 示例：</p>\n\n            <div\n              class=\"graphviz-container graphviz-enlargeable\" \n              data-graph-id=\"graph-szm919\" \n              data-graph-definition='digraph BST_Example { node [shape=circle, style=filled, fillcolor=\"#a5d8ff\", fontname=\"Helvetica\"]; edge [color=\"#495057\"]; 50 -> 30; 50 -> 70; 30 -> 20; 30 -> 40; 70 -> 60; 70 -> 80; 20 [fillcolor=\"#d0bfff\"]; 40 [fillcolor=\"#d0bfff\"]; 60 [fillcolor=\"#d0bfff\"]; 80 [fillcolor=\"#d0bfff\"]; 50 [fillcolor=\"#74c0fc\", fontcolor=\"white\"]; 30 [fillcolor=\"#91a7ff\"]; 70 [fillcolor=\"#91a7ff\"]; }' \n              data-original-width=\"1200px\"\n              style=\"max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; cursor: pointer; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-height: 200px;\"\n              title=\"Click to enlarge\"\n              aria-label=\"Graphviz diagram - click to enlarge\"\n              tabindex=\"0\"\n              role=\"button\"\n              onclick=\"window.enlargeGraphviz(this)\"\n              onkeydown=\"if(event.key==='Enter') window.enlargeGraphviz(this)\"\n            >\n              <div id=\"graph-szm919\" style=\"width: 100%; min-height: 200px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\"></div>\n            </div>\n          \n<blockquote>\n<p>一棵二叉搜索树，其中每个左子节点都小于其父节点，每个右子节点都大于其父节点。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3>在 BST 中查找</h3>\n<p>BST 性质的主要优点是查找速度快。要查找一个值（称之为 <code>target</code>）：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>从根节点开始。</li>\n<li>将 <code>target</code> 与当前节点的值比较。</li>\n<li>如果 <code>target</code> 与节点的值匹配，表示已找到。</li>\n<li>如果 <code>target</code> <em>小于</em>节点的值，则移到左子节点并从步骤 2 重复。如果没有左子节点，则 <code>target</code> 不在树中。</li>\n<li>如果 <code>target</code> <em>大于</em>节点的值，则移到右子节点并从步骤 2 重复。如果没有右子节点，则 <code>target</code> 不在树中。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>由于每次比较有效地排除了大约一半的剩余节点（在相对平衡的树中），查找操作的时间通常与树的高度成正比。对于一个包含 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span> 个节点的平衡 BST，其高度大约是 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\log_2 n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9386em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span>。<strong>因此</strong>，查找的平均<strong>时间复杂度</strong>是 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span>。这种对数性能比未排序列表或数组所需的 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span> 线性查找要快得多，尤其是在大数据集中。</p>\n<h3>向 BST 中插入</h3>\n<p>向 BST 中添加新值必须保持其搜索性质。插入过程与查找类似：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>从根节点开始。</li>\n<li>将新值与当前节点的值比较。</li>\n<li>如果新值<em>小于</em>节点的值，则移到左子节点。如果没有左子节点，则将新值作为左子节点插入。否则，将左子节点作为当前节点，从步骤 2 重复。</li>\n<li>如果新值<em>大于或等于</em>节点的值（或者仅大于，取决于是否允许重复值以及如何处理），则移到右子节点。如果没有右子节点，则将新值作为右子节点插入。否则，将右子节点作为当前节点，从步骤 2 重复。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>与查找一样，插入操作也沿着从根到叶节点位置的路径。因此，在平衡树中，其平均时间复杂度也是 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span>。</p>\n\n            <div\n              class=\"graphviz-container graphviz-enlargeable\" \n              data-graph-id=\"graph-1r7au55\" \n              data-graph-definition='digraph BST_Insert { rankdir=LR; node [shape=circle, style=filled, fillcolor=\"#a5d8ff\", fontname=\"Helvetica\"]; edge [color=\"#495057\"]; subgraph cluster_before { label=\"插入 45 之前\"; bgcolor=\"#f8f9fa\"; 50 -> 30; 50 -> 70; 30 -> 20; 30 -> 40; 70 -> 60; 70 -> 80; 50 [fillcolor=\"#74c0fc\", fontcolor=\"white\"]; 30 [fillcolor=\"#91a7ff\"]; 70 [fillcolor=\"#91a7ff\"]; 20 [fillcolor=\"#d0bfff\"]; 40 [fillcolor=\"#d0bfff\"]; 60 [fillcolor=\"#d0bfff\"]; 80 [fillcolor=\"#d0bfff\"]; } subgraph cluster_after { label=\"插入 45 之后\"; bgcolor=\"#f8f9fa\"; 50_a -> 30_a; 50_a -> 70_a; 30_a -> 20_a; 30_a -> 40_a; 70_a -> 60_a; 70_a -> 80_a; 40_a -> 45_a [style=dashed, color=\"#f03e3e\"]; 50_a [label=\"50\", fillcolor=\"#74c0fc\", fontcolor=\"white\"]; 30_a [label=\"30\", fillcolor=\"#91a7ff\"]; 70_a [label=\"70\", fillcolor=\"#91a7ff\"]; 20_a [label=\"20\", fillcolor=\"#d0bfff\"]; 40_a [label=\"40\", fillcolor=\"#91a7ff\"]; 60_a [label=\"60\", fillcolor=\"#d0bfff\"]; 80_a [label=\"80\", fillcolor=\"#d0bfff\"]; 45_a [label=\"45\", fillcolor=\"#ffc9c9\", penwidth=2, color=\"#f03e3e\"]; } }' \n              data-original-width=\"1200px\"\n              style=\"max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; cursor: pointer; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-height: 200px;\"\n              title=\"Click to enlarge\"\n              aria-label=\"Graphviz diagram - click to enlarge\"\n              tabindex=\"0\"\n              role=\"button\"\n              onclick=\"window.enlargeGraphviz(this)\"\n              onkeydown=\"if(event.key==='Enter') window.enlargeGraphviz(this)\"\n            >\n              <div id=\"graph-1r7au55\" style=\"width: 100%; min-height: 200px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\"></div>\n            </div>\n          \n<blockquote>\n<p>将值 45 插入 BST。搜索路径（50 -> 30 -> 40）决定了其在 40 的右子节点位置。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3>从 BST 中删除</h3>\n<p>删除操作稍微复杂一些，因为移除节点可能破坏 BST 性质或使树断开连接。有以下三种情况：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>要删除的节点是叶节点（无子节点）：</strong> 直接移除该节点。</li>\n<li><strong>要删除的节点有一个子节点：</strong> 用其子节点替换该节点。子树相对于被删除节点的父节点，保持 BST 性质。</li>\n<li><strong>要删除的节点有两个子节点：</strong> 这是最麻烦的情况。不能直接移除该节点。而是用以下两者之一替换节点的值：\n<ul>\n<li>其<strong>中序后继</strong>的值（其右子树中最小的值）。</li>\n<li>其<strong>中序前驱</strong>的值（其左子树中最大的值）。\n然后，递归删除您取出替换值的那个节点（这个节点最多有一个子节点，属于情况 1 或 2）。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p>查找要删除的节点平均需要 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span> 时间。后续步骤（查找后继/前驱并执行较简单的删除）通常也需要对数时间。因此，删除的平均时间复杂度保持为 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<h3>性能考量：平衡的需求</h3>\n<p>查找、插入和删除操作的理想 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span> 平均时间复杂度取决于树是否相对<strong>平衡</strong>。如果数据以排序或近似排序的顺序插入，BST 可能退化为类似链表的结构。</p>\n\n            <div\n              class=\"graphviz-container graphviz-enlargeable\" \n              data-graph-id=\"graph-12ttg5l\" \n              data-graph-definition='digraph BST_Compare { rankdir=LR; node [shape=circle, style=filled, fontname=\"Helvetica\"]; edge [color=\"#495057\"]; subgraph cluster_balanced { label=\"平衡 BST\"; bgcolor=\"#f8f9fa\"; A_50 [label=\"50\", fillcolor=\"#74c0fc\", fontcolor=\"white\"]; A_30 [label=\"30\", fillcolor=\"#91a7ff\"]; A_70 [label=\"70\", fillcolor=\"#91a7ff\"]; A_20 [label=\"20\", fillcolor=\"#d0bfff\"]; A_40 [label=\"40\", fillcolor=\"#d0bfff\"]; A_60 [label=\"60\", fillcolor=\"#d0bfff\"]; A_80 [label=\"80\", fillcolor=\"#d0bfff\"]; A_50 -> A_30; A_50 -> A_70; A_30 -> A_20; A_30 -> A_40; A_70 -> A_60; A_70 -> A_80; } subgraph cluster_skewed { label=\"倾斜 BST (排序输入: 20, 30, 40, 50, 60, 70, 80)\"; bgcolor=\"#f8f9fa\"; B_20 [label=\"20\", fillcolor=\"#ffc9c9\"]; B_30 [label=\"30\", fillcolor=\"#ffa8a8\"]; B_40 [label=\"40\", fillcolor=\"#ff8787\"]; B_50 [label=\"50\", fillcolor=\"#ff6b6b\"]; B_60 [label=\"60\", fillcolor=\"#fa5252\"]; B_70 [label=\"70\", fillcolor=\"#f03e3e\", fontcolor=\"white\"]; B_80 [label=\"80\", fillcolor=\"#f03e3e\", fontcolor=\"white\"]; B_20 -> B_30; B_30 -> B_40; B_40 -> B_50; B_50 -> B_60; B_60 -> B_70; B_70 -> B_80; } }' \n              data-original-width=\"1200px\"\n              style=\"max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; cursor: pointer; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-height: 200px;\"\n              title=\"Click to enlarge\"\n              aria-label=\"Graphviz diagram - click to enlarge\"\n              tabindex=\"0\"\n              role=\"button\"\n              onclick=\"window.enlargeGraphviz(this)\"\n              onkeydown=\"if(event.key==='Enter') window.enlargeGraphviz(this)\"\n            >\n              <div id=\"graph-12ttg5l\" style=\"width: 100%; min-height: 200px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\"></div>\n            </div>\n          \n<blockquote>\n<p>平衡 BST（左侧）与通过按排序顺序插入元素形成的倾斜 BST（右侧）的比较。在倾斜树中查找的性能会下降到 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span>。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>在这种倾斜情况下，树的高度变为 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span>，所有操作的性能下降到 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span>，与链表相同。这说明了为什么自平衡 BST（例如 AVL 树或红黑树），我们接下来将简要讨论它们，在实践中通常更受欢迎，以确保即使在最坏情况下也能保持对数性能。</p>\n<h3>与机器学习 (machine learning)的相关性</h3>\n<p>虽然您可能不会直接将简单的 BST 用作许多复杂机器学习模型的核心组成部分，但了解它们很重要：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>索引：</strong> BST（及其平衡变体）是数据库索引的重要组成部分，数据库索引常用于加快机器学习训练集或特征查找的数据检索。</li>\n<li><strong>决策树的原理：</strong> 基于比较递归划分数据的原理是决策树运行方式的主要方面。决策树中的每个节点都进行一次划分，这与 BST 指导搜索向左或向右类似，尽管决策树是基于特征阈值而非单纯的值比较进行划分的。</li>\n<li><strong>高效查找：</strong> 在机器学习流程中需要频繁查找、插入和删除元素的场景（例如，管理活跃特征、维护某些类型的缓存）下，当还需要有序遍历或范围查询时，类似 BST 的结构可以提供比简单列表或哈希表更好的性能。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>二叉搜索树提供了一种巧妙的方式来动态维护排序数据，为查找提供了高效的平均情况性能。它们的主要局限性在于倾斜数据可能导致性能下降，这促使了对接下来将讨论的平衡树结构的需求。</p>",
